INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Is debugging a DevOps practice?

Answer

No.

Debugging is a software development activity. DevOps focuses on
automation, collaboration, CI/CD, monitoring, and infrastructure
management.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. Is Continuous Integration a DevOps practice or a DevOps goal?

Answer

Continuous Integration is a DevOps practice used to achieve DevOps
goals.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Is automation limited to deployment?

Answer

No.

Automation is applied to building, testing, deployment, infrastructure
provisioning, monitoring, and other repetitive tasks.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. What is the purpose of Infrastructure as Code (IaC)?

Answer

Infrastructure as Code manages infrastructure using code instead of
manual configuration, ensuring consistency, repeatability, and easier
maintenance.

